  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/love_luxury), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10786826), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000062056), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4419005328), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/10516), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63650380)\n\nSim Yun, who has excellent grades, good looks, and a perfect score, thinks dating is a luxury in order to reach her dream safely. However, she is kind to everyone and begins to care about her friend's partner, Kwon Min-ha, who has a harmonious family unlike her...",
